[
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "heading": {
      "text": "11. Arsitektur Deployment & Skalabilitas",
      "level": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
      "text": "Bagian ini mendefinisikan blueprint infrastruktur produksi untuk Aegis-JKN, memastikan sistem mampu menangani beban data klaim masif dengan ketersediaan tinggi (High Availability) dan kepatuhan ketat terhadap regulasi data kesehatan."
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "heading",
    "heading": {
      "text": "11.1 Model Deployment & Orkestrasi",
      "level": 3
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
      "text": "Aegis-JKN mengadopsi strategi GitOps untuk menjamin konsistensi antara konfigurasi repositori dan state infrastruktur."
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
      "text": "Multi-environment Pipeline: Dev (Feature Branch) → Staging (Main Branch/QA) → Production (Tagged Release).",
      "bulleted_list_item_rich_text": []
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
      "text": "Infrastructure: Kubernetes (EKS/GKE/AKS) menggunakan Helm Charts untuk manajemen paket aplikasi.",
      "bulleted_list_item_rich_text": []
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
      "text": "Continuous Delivery: ArgoCD untuk sinkronisasi otomatis antara Git repo dan cluster K8s.",
      "bulleted_list_item_rich_text": []
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "bulleted_list_item",
    "bulleted_list_item": {
      "text": "Service Mesh: Istio untuk manajemen traffic (canary deployment), mTLS antar-service, dan observabilitas jaringan.",
      "bulleted_list_item_rich_text": []
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "paragraph": {
      "text": "Diagram Arsitektur High-Level:"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "code",
    "code": {
      "text": "mermaid\ngraph TD\n    User((Verifier/Auditor)) --> WAF[Cloud WAF/Shield]\n    WAF --> Gateway[API Gateway: Kong/Traefik]\n    \n    subgraph \"K8s Cluster\"\n        Gateway --> Web[Next.js Web Tier]\n        Gateway --> API[FastAPI Backend Tier]\n        API --> ML[ML Serving: Triton/TorchServe]\n        API --> Workers[Batch Workers: Ray/Argo]\n        \n        subgraph \"Persistence Layer\"\n            API --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL Aurora)]\n            API --> GraphDB[(FalkorDB Cluster)]\n            API --> VectorDB[(Qdrant Cluster)]\n            API --> Cache[(Redis Cluster)]\n        end\n    end\n    \n    ML --> GPU[GPU Node Pool]\n    Workers --> S3[S3/MinIO Data Lake]\n    \n    style GPU fill:#f96,stroke:#333\n    style GraphDB fill:#bbf,stroke:#333\n    style VectorDB fill:#bbf,stroke:#333",
      "language": "mermaid"
    }
  },
